MID_SE_Led_Oly_C: <EDH>
MID_SE_Led_Oly_C_001: Leilidahna! On this day I shall be victorious at last!\nAnd so...I challenge you!
MID_SE_Led_Oly_C_002: Don't you ever learn? Please, you must have\nsomething better to do.
MID_SE_Led_Oly_C_003: I do not. Defeating you is my greatest desire!
MID_SE_Led_Oly_C_004: Once and for all, I will prove that I am the one most\nworthy of the title Rose of Caelus! Not you.
MID_SE_Led_Oly_C_005: {SetColor=Gray}Ugh, it never stops. She's such a pain in the saddle.{SetColor=Default}
MID_SE_Led_Oly_C_006: If winning is that important to you, I'll just tell you\nmy weakness.
MID_SE_Led_Oly_C_007: You dare mock me?! I will NOT accept an act of\ncharity from my sworn enemy!
MID_SE_Led_Oly_C_008: Oh? Well, if that's how you feel, I'll take this secret\nto the grave with me.
MID_SE_Led_Oly_C_009: I...I suppose it would be impolite of me not to accept\nyour sad little gesture. Very well, I shall hear it.
MID_SE_Led_Oly_C_010: The truth is I'm absolutely awful at cooking. Doesn't\nmatter what I do, the food I make is just...disgusting.
MID_SE_Led_Oly_C_011: C-cooking...you say?
MID_SE_Led_Oly_C_012: As the Rose of Caelus, I'm supposed to have\nmastered all of the arts.
MID_SE_Led_Oly_C_013: Singing and dancing are valued most, as you know,\nbut mastery of the culinary arts is important too.
MID_SE_Led_Oly_C_014: If you beat me in a cooking challenge, I'm sure your\nstanding will get a big boost.
MID_SE_Led_Oly_C_015: Rrrgh!
MID_SE_Led_Oly_C_016: Why are you making that face? I told you my secret.\nIt's embarrassing. You should be smiling.
MID_SE_Led_Oly_C_017: In fact, I would expect that you, of all people, would\nbe jumping for joy.
MID_SE_Led_Oly_C_018: I cannot rejoice at all, Leilidahna. You see...
MID_SE_Led_Oly_C_019: I am also...terrible at cooking.
MID_SE_Led_Oly_C_020: Oh.
MID_SE_Led_Oly_B: <EDH>
MID_SE_Led_Oly_B_001: There you are, Leilidahna. I have come to\nchallenge you!
MID_SE_Led_Oly_B_002: Oh, Olympia...sorry. Can we do this another time?
MID_SE_Led_Oly_B_003: You seem to be here in body but not in spirit, as\nthey say. Is something on your mind?
MID_SE_Led_Oly_B_004: Yes. Bertrand.
MID_SE_Led_Oly_B_005: He floats into my mind without warning and fills me\nwith thoughts of revenge.
MID_SE_Led_Oly_B_006: Humph. It's Bertrand this and Bertrand that! Night\nand day, Leilidahna. That's all you talk about.
MID_SE_Led_Oly_B_007: While I understand that powerful desires can give\nus something to live for...
MID_SE_Led_Oly_B_008: I do not appreciate this thing where you ignore me\nso that you can think about Bertrand.
MID_SE_Led_Oly_B_009: What do you want me to do? I can't help it. It's\nlike...like...being in love, I suppose.
MID_SE_Led_Oly_B_010: If I'm going to get my revenge, I must stay focused on\nthis one person. They must never leave my thoughts.
MID_SE_Led_Oly_B_011: What a strange thing to say! That is nothing like\nlove at all.
MID_SE_Led_Oly_B_012: If it were, then that would mean I am in love with\nyou, Leilidahna.
MID_SE_Led_Oly_B_013: What are you talking about? Your thing with me\nis...totally different.
MID_SE_Led_Oly_B_014: It is the same! Ever since the day you stole the\nRose of Caelus title from me...
MID_SE_Led_Oly_B_015: I have never stopped thinking of you! Not once!
MID_SE_Led_Oly_B_016: Night and day, day and night...I am unable to banish\nyour face from my mind!
MID_SE_Led_Oly_B_017: I see.
MID_SE_Led_Oly_B_018: If that's how it is, Olympia...would you like to be\nmy girlfriend?
MID_SE_Led_Oly_B_019: Girlfriend?! Me?! Why, I...I...
MID_SE_Led_Oly_B_020: You cannot be serious! Leilidahna! You are\nshameless!
MID_SE_Led_Oly_B_021: Sorry, sorry, I was kidding! I just couldn't\nhelp myself.
MID_SE_Led_Oly_B_022: *gasp* You were teasing me! I do not appreciate you\nhaving fun at my expense!
MID_SE_Led_Oly_B_023: I said I was sorry. It's just...what you said made me\nfeel better, that's all.
MID_SE_Led_Oly_B_024: Hearing that someone has occupied your thoughts\nnonstop over the years...
MID_SE_Led_Oly_B_025: I didn't think anyone could understand what that's\nlike...definitely not anyone close to me. It's a relief.
MID_SE_Led_Oly_B_026: A relief... Indeed. I will not have you suffering alone.\nYou must depend upon me more often, Leilidahna.
MID_SE_Led_Oly_B_027: I think I will. Thank you, Olympia.
MID_SE_Led_Oly_A: <EDH>
MID_SE_Led_Oly_A_001: More enemies are coming. Olympia, can you\nkeep going?
MID_SE_Led_Oly_A_002: Please. Who do you think I am? I shall pluck off\nthese foes as though they were new flowers in bloom.
MID_SE_Led_Oly_A_003: Hehehe. I can always depend on you. Alright then...\nattack!
MID_SE_Led_Oly_A_004: Indeed! Hraah!
MID_SE_Led_Oly_A_005: That was the last of them. Are you OK?
MID_SE_Led_Oly_A_006: But of course. I am the Blue Rose of Caelus!
MID_SE_Led_Oly_A_007: No matter the predicament I'm in, I will not be\nplucked of my petals nor snapped off at the stem.
MID_SE_Led_Oly_A_008: Your pride remains unbroken, even in times like\nthese. It's impressive. Honestly.
MID_SE_Led_Oly_A_009: The same goes for you, Leilidahna. You do not\nchange. You are as strong and as lovely as ever.
MID_SE_Led_Oly_A_010: They say that when we fight together, it looks like\na beautiful dance. Did you know that?
MID_SE_Led_Oly_A_011: Yes, I'd heard. I suppose I should consider it\na compliment.
MID_SE_Led_Oly_A_012: No doubt our enemies are overjoyed to lay eyes upon\nour dance...just before they're felled by it.
MID_SE_Led_Oly_A_013: To tell you the truth, it feels a bit strange.
MID_SE_Led_Oly_A_014: When I used to sing and dance at the temple...\nI never thought I'd have so much blood on my hands.
MID_SE_Led_Oly_A_015: Please, Leilidahna. Enough with that grim look of\nyours. I, for one, am feeling quite refreshed.
MID_SE_Led_Oly_A_016: You see, I have chased after you for so very long,\nand now here I am...standing by your side.
MID_SE_Led_Oly_A_017: Is that really all you think about? Your tenacity\nis the one thing I can't compete with.
MID_SE_Led_Oly_A_018: Fine, I admit it. I lose.
MID_SE_Led_Oly_A_019: What do you mean? I have issued no challenge.\nThere can be no winning or losing. Not now.
MID_SE_Led_Oly_A_020: We shall continue our bouts once peace has been\nrestored. Then and only then shall I be victorious.
MID_SE_Led_Oly_A_021: As you wish. We'll settle things between us once\nand for all...but first, peace.
MID_SE_Led_Oly_A_022: There are so many things I need to brush up on.\nSinging, dancing, playing music...
MID_SE_Led_Oly_A_023: Oh, and cooking. We really have to work on our\nculinary skills.
MID_SE_Led_Oly_A_024: We do! Oh, how I look forward to practicing all those\nskills once more.